│ │                                         │ Wait, 2 times 250 is... 250 + 250 is    │                     │           │ │
│ │                                         │ 500. So Rachel needs to spend $500.     │                     │           │ │
│ │                                         │                                         │                     │           │ │
│ │                                         │ But how does that make sense? If Sara   │                     │           │ │
│ │                                         │ spent $250, and Rachel wants to spend   │                     │           │ │
│ │                                         │ twice as much, that means Rachel's      │                     │           │ │
│ │                                         │ money is double. So, 250 times 2 is     │                     │           │ │
│ │                                         │ 500.                                    │                     │           │ │
│ │                                         │                                         │                     │           │ │
│ │                                         │ So, the answer is $500.                 │                     │           │ │
│ │                                         │                                         │                     │           │ │
│ │                                         │ But to make it simple for a 7-year-old, │                     │           │ │
│ │                                         │ maybe we can say:                       │                     │           │ │
│ │                                         │                                         │                     │           │ │
│ │                                         │ "Sara spent $50 on shoes and $200 on a  │                     │           │ │
│ │                                         │ dress. That's $250 total. Rachel wants  │                     │           │ │
│ │                                         │ to spend twice that, so she needs       │                     │           │ │
│ │                                         │ $500."                                  │                     │           │ │
│ │                                         │                                         │                     │           │ │
│ │                                         │ Yeah, that's straightforward. So the    │                     │           │ │
│ │                                         │ final answer is $500.                   │                     │           │ │
